# diff-dlower's known differences (tests/differential/dlower.zig): one fixture per
# line, its path under tests/conformance/tests and why it does not agree yet:
# a construct Sema's digital lowering (src/Sema/digital*) does not lower yet
# (`lowering: ...`), a stage before it that refuses the fixture, or the first
# transcript difference. A listed fixture that agrees fails the run until its
# line goes.
